    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμοχλ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lift out with a lever,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				72
			</span></i> (and in 
				Med.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				76
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύλας ἐ.</span>
			<i>to force</i> them <i>open with crow-bars,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				429
			</span></i> : generally, <i>force, compel,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.662c
				</span></i>
			; <i>dislodge,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λυποῦντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.195
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.1.22
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κακοχυμίαν τῶν σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Grg.</u>
					p.143J.
				</span></i>
			</div>
